            <rule id="5fe8-8c62-c368-cc67" name="Granted: Man-O-War Mechanik" hidden="false">
              <description>While this model is in play, models in its unit can make a Repair special action to attempt to repair damaged Man-O-War models as if they werer warjacks. Models in this model&apos;s unit with Assist Repair can make an Assist Repair special action to assist in the repair of Man-O-War models.</description>
