    <selectionEntry id="1956-e79f-bea4-0ff1" name="Devastator" publicationId="2c35-dc21-pubN67109" page="73" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="model">
      <rules>
        <rule id="6f91-5a4b-5127-22e6" name="Armored Shell" hidden="false">
          <description>While one of its arm systems is crippled, this model&apos;s base ARM is 21; while both its arm systems are crippled, its base ARM is 17. If this model makes an attack other than a head-butt, slam, or trample power attack, its base ARM is 17 until the start of its next activation. This model&apos;s arms cannot be locked.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="6006-48ce-851d-7307" name="Rain of Death (* Attack)" hidden="false">
          <description>Models B2B with this model suffer a POW 18 blast damage roll. Other models within 3&quot; of this model suffer a POW 9 blast damage roll. When this model charges, instead of making a charge attack it can make a Rain of Death attack. A Rain of Death attack does not need a target. After a Rain of Death attack, this model can make additional melee attacks.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
