          <description>Center a 3&quot; AOE cloud effect on this model. Living models currently in the AOE are hit and suffer a POW 12 damage roll. The AOE remains in play for one round. A vent Steam attack does not need a target. After a Vent Steam attack, this model can make additional melee attacks.</description>
