      <rules>
        <rule id="97dc-d1d5-591a-9ca2" name="Feat: Undying Loyalty" hidden="false">
          <description>While in Irusk&apos;s control area, friendly Faction warrior models/units gain Fearless, Tough, and +2 to melee and ranged attack rolls and cannot be knocked down. When a friendly Faction warrior models makes a Tough roll of 4, 5, or 6 while in Irusk&apos;s control area, that model heals 1 damage point. Undying Loyalty lasts for one round.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
