        <rule id="b785-cc91-7fe6-32ee" name="Jury-Rigged [SPD]" hidden="false">
          <description>At the start of its activation, this model can spend 1 focus point to use Jury-
Rigged. This model gains +2 SPD this activation. At the end of this activation, it suffers 1 damage point to its first available Movement system box. This model cannot use Jury-Rigged if its Movement system is crippled. Jury-Rigged can be used only once per activation.</description>
