          <description>Choose two table edges. Enemy models beginning an advance in Magnus&apos; control area cannot advance toward those table edges for one round.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="ff9e2407-cc7e-e35d-7273-89c91d60efef" name="Warjack Bond" publicationId="2c35-dc21-pubN65551" page="40" hidden="false">
          <description>One non-character warjack in Magnus&apos; battlegroup can begin the game bonded to him. The warjack gains Backstab.</description>
        </rule>
