      <rules>
        <rule id="9829-3cb9-0caa-0eff" name="Drive: Boosted Attack" hidden="false">
          <description>This model can attempt to drive each warjack under its control in its command range. To drive a warjack, this model must make a command check at any time during its activation. If it passes, the attack rolls for the warjack&apos;s initial attacks are boosted during that activation. If it fails, the warjack does not benefit from &apos;Jack Marshal this turn.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="053d-dff3-472e-be24" name="Field Officer [Man-O-War Shocktrooper or Man-O-War Demolition Corps]" hidden="false">
          <description>If this model is included in an army, you can include one additional Man-O-War Shocktrooper ro Man-O-War Demolition Corps unit over that unit&apos;s FA.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="ba70-8822-a1ab-1a76" name="Power Attack Slam" hidden="false">
          <description>This model can make slam power attacks.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="4fc9-8755-b7e5-0554" name="Khador Dragoon Character Solo" hidden="false"/>
