      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="cdb0fbf5-d5a4-4961-9df8-fd5f5eabc7b9" name="Magic Ability [7]" hidden="false">
          <description>- Arc Lightning (* Attack) - Arc Lightning is a RNG 10 magic attack. A model hit by this spell suffers a POW 10 electrical damage roll, and ligntining arcs from it to d3 consecutive additional models. The lightning arcs to the nearest model it has not arced to within 4&quot; of the last model it araced to, ignoring this model. Each model the lightning arcs to suffers a POW 10 electrical damage roll.

- Null Magic (* Action) - For one round, models cannot cast spells while within 12&quot; of this model.

- Stealth (* Action) -  This model gains Stealth for one round.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="cfd6e834-2d55-1dfd-4a3a-5ee90782e6d7" hidden="false" targetId="400b902b-958e-5f17-8920-0df3fad42c49" type="rule" name="Mercenary: Cryx"/>
