            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule id="496a-969a-a420-f22d" name="Energy Vacuum" hidden="false">
              <description>When an enemy model casts a spell while within 12&quot; of this model, this model gains one power token. It can have up to three power tokens at a time. During its activation, this model can spend power tokens to gain additional attacks or to boost attack or damage rolls at one token per attack or boost.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
