            <rule id="fb717e6e-dc0f-a7f9-0717-46bcf88eb927" name="No Quarter" hidden="false">
              <description>Once per game during its unit&apos;s activation, this model can use No Quarter. Models in this unit gain Fearless, Pathfinder and Terror. A model in this unit that charges gains +2&quot; movement. No Quarter lasts for one round.</description>
