          <rules>
            <rule id="9aae-f287-f772-58af" name="Targeting Flare" hidden="false">
              <description>Instead of making an attack with this weapon, you can place a 3&quot; AOE anywhere completely within 10&quot; of this model, with a center point in this model&apos;s LOS, ignoring intervening models. While a model is within AOE, it loses Camoflagoue and Stealth and models can ignore cloud effects when determining LOS to it. The AOE remains in play for one turn.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <infoLinks>
