      <rules>
        <rule id="618f-2344-bd5a-720a" name="Guard Dog" hidden="false">
          <description>While this model is within 3&quot; of its warcaster or warlock and is not knocked down or stationary, its warcaster or warlock cannot be targeted by free strikes and gains +2 DEF against melee attack rolls, and models attacking the warcaster do not gain back strike bonuses.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="3acb-676e-50d7-87a9" name="Return" hidden="false">
          <description>Immediately after resolving a charge attack, this model can make a full advance toward its warcaster. This model cannot be targeted by free strikes during this movement.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
